{
  "comment": "Recipes for the ManiOS package repository (tools/mkrepo.py). Each DOS package is built from an unmodified FreeDOS package zip; the zip itself is published beside it as the corresponding source. Only programs that are Working in docs/compatibility/database.json and whose licence allows redistribution are listed. Commands that would clash with a built-in /bin program get a 'd' prefix. Left out for now: find (FreeDOS FIND looks for relative names on A:, which a launcher cannot arrange) and unzip (the FreeDOS 1.4 package is the 32-bit DJGPP build, which needs DPMI).",
